videos.overview:
The Top 4 contestants performed songs chosen by the judges. Here's a break down of the performances:

Tyler Lewis - Big League by Tom Cocheran; Heaven by Eric Clapton;

Chad Doucette - Hanging By A Moment by Lifehouse; Everybody Hurts by R.E.M.;

Craig Sharp - Careless Whisper by George Michael; Tears Of A Clown by Smokey Robinson;

Eva Avila - Would I Lie To You? by Eurythmics; Old Skool Love by Divine Brown

The Top 3 contestants performed Pop Standards with the help of Tony Bennett. Here's a break down of the performances:

Craig Sharp: The Way You Look Tonight and Danny Boy;

Eva Avila: God Bless The Child and They Can't Take That Away From Me;

Tyler Lewis: Just A Gigalo/I Ain't Got Nobody and It Had To Be You.
